name=Water Physicality - Viewpoint
id=WaterPhysicality
description=Water for sinks, bathtubs and showers. With Project Viewpoint (and ZombieBuddy) the water and tap streams are real 3D models; without it you get the same water painted into the base game's isometric view. Fixtures show water while you drink, wash or fill a container at them. Take A Bath And Shower and Lifestyle: Hobbies are optional and detected at runtime: tubs fill and drain with their baths and showers run. No required mods. In multiplayer the server needs the mod enabled. Use "Water Physicality - Flat" instead if you never play with Viewpoint: the two cannot be enabled together.
